  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, we know,<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow></mrow></msub></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> Potential difference <math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />Putting given values, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></munderover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>dx</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>dr</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>dz</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><math> <mrow> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>"
